T1  - The united states department of veteran affairs healthcare system (VAHS) provides a suitable multi-institutional setting for phase III randomized trials of stereotactic ablative radiotherapy (SABR) versus lobectomy in patients with medically operable stage I non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC)
