T1  - Assessing the value of preoperative chemotherapy in early-stage non-small cell lung cancer: Mature data and prognostic factors analysis of a phase III randomized trial of surgery alone vs preoperative Paclitaxel/Carboplatin (PC) vs postoperative PC. Final NATCH data. A Spanish lung cancer group trial
